WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.334 --> 00:00:02.308
- Today I'm going to give
you a quick book contest

00:00:02.308 --> 00:00:06.141
update as well as some
exciting announcements.

00:00:08.171 --> 00:00:10.754
(upbeat music)

00:00:15.915 --> 00:00:17.354
What's up, Believe
Nation, welcome to another

00:00:17.354 --> 00:00:19.408
edition of Evan's Book.

00:00:19.408 --> 00:00:21.934
I'm excited to dig into the contest.

00:00:21.934 --> 00:00:24.541
I've had it for the past
two weeks on the channel

00:00:24.541 --> 00:00:28.099
to have a contest to give away
10 signed copies of my book

00:00:28.099 --> 00:00:30.525
for people who create some art around it.

00:00:30.525 --> 00:00:33.405
I'm actually filming this on
Wednesday, my normal filming

00:00:33.405 --> 00:00:35.709
day, which is December
28th, and so I can't

00:00:35.709 --> 00:00:39.572
announce the contest winners
yet because I want to give

00:00:39.572 --> 00:00:42.176
a little bit more time for
you guys to create some art.

00:00:42.176 --> 00:00:44.754
So, I know this is coming
up to you guys live already

00:00:44.754 --> 00:00:48.581
on January 2nd, but I'm filming
it December 28th, so next

00:00:48.581 --> 00:00:51.889
week I'm going to be picking the winners.

00:00:51.889 --> 00:00:53.028
Good luck to you all!

00:00:53.028 --> 00:00:56.672
I'm excited to see what
you have come up with.

00:00:56.672 --> 00:00:58.527
While I've got you here,
though, I wanted to also share

00:00:58.527 --> 00:01:00.528
a couple of exciting
announcements that I have

00:01:00.528 --> 00:01:03.206
for the book series and
see what you guys think.

00:01:03.206 --> 00:01:04.942
I'm going to see how I feel
about them, but here are some

00:01:04.942 --> 00:01:08.144
of the ideas that I'm playing
with, so first off is going to

00:01:08.144 --> 00:01:11.473
be the book club hangouts,
doing a weekly series for seven

00:01:11.473 --> 00:01:14.410
weeks for each chapter of
the book to help people

00:01:14.410 --> 00:01:16.092
along the way, where you guys can join in

00:01:16.092 --> 00:01:18.571
on the live hangout, ask me
questions, chat with other

00:01:18.571 --> 00:01:20.398
Believe Nation members
who are reading the book,

00:01:20.398 --> 00:01:21.634
because I really, again, want to make sure

00:01:21.634 --> 00:01:23.510
that people are reading the
book, they understand it,

00:01:23.510 --> 00:01:24.929
they're getting the value from it,

00:01:24.929 --> 00:01:26.732
and so anything that I can
do to help make sure that you

00:01:26.732 --> 00:01:29.494
are getting value from it,
you're taking action on it,

00:01:29.494 --> 00:01:31.208
you're actually reading the
book and applying it to your

00:01:31.208 --> 00:01:33.569
life or business, I want to
make sure that gets done.

00:01:33.569 --> 00:01:36.501
That series may continue,
may just be a one-off, seven

00:01:36.501 --> 00:01:37.727
weeks, that's it.

00:01:37.727 --> 00:01:39.820
It may be an ongoing thing
where we repeat it again and

00:01:39.820 --> 00:01:43.079
maybe have some special guests
come in who are in the book

00:01:43.079 --> 00:01:45.361
or people who are going through
the process of reading the

00:01:45.361 --> 00:01:47.000
book and helping them live.

00:01:47.000 --> 00:01:48.539
I don't know, playing with some ideas.

00:01:48.539 --> 00:01:51.082
I'm open to some feedback, but
that's going to probably start

00:01:51.082 --> 00:01:53.207
right after we finish the contest.

00:01:53.207 --> 00:01:54.918
Some other ideas that
I had were to do some

00:01:54.918 --> 00:01:56.365
book reaction videos.

00:01:56.365 --> 00:01:59.093
A number of you have sent in
the videos of you unboxing

00:01:59.093 --> 00:02:01.616
your book or sent in a thank
you message, and I thought

00:02:01.616 --> 00:02:04.968
about smashing all those up
into one video, 'cause they

00:02:04.968 --> 00:02:07.922
made me feel so good and happy
when I saw them and to give

00:02:07.922 --> 00:02:11.383
some love and exposure for you
guys for making the videos,

00:02:11.383 --> 00:02:14.361
I might do that, so also pro
tip, if you guys are making

00:02:14.361 --> 00:02:16.938
reaction videos, send them to
me so they can be part of that

00:02:16.938 --> 00:02:19.410
mashup and get some
exposure on the channel too.

00:02:19.410 --> 00:02:22.826
I'm thinking about making a
what I learned as a message

00:02:22.826 --> 00:02:25.508
to myself for going through
this again, 'cause there's been

00:02:25.508 --> 00:02:27.925
some things I think I did really well

00:02:27.925 --> 00:02:29.336
in launching this book, and some things

00:02:29.336 --> 00:02:31.798
that could definitely
be improved next time

00:02:31.798 --> 00:02:34.774
around that I need to remember
in case I do it again.

00:02:34.774 --> 00:02:36.221
I need to watch this video back.

00:02:36.221 --> 00:02:40.388
It's a message from Evan, from
past Evan to the next Evan

00:02:41.306 --> 00:02:43.878
when I'm going through this
again to do these things

00:02:43.878 --> 00:02:45.670
because it could've been
so easy and could've saved

00:02:45.670 --> 00:02:48.801
a lot of headaches, so
I'm already planning that,

00:02:48.801 --> 00:02:50.348
so it's another idea.

00:02:50.348 --> 00:02:52.433
And then the last one I
had, at least on my list

00:02:52.433 --> 00:02:56.908
of current ideas, is to
do a series of from rookie

00:02:56.908 --> 00:03:01.774
to best-selling author, and
every week kind of comparing

00:03:01.774 --> 00:03:04.700
how my book is doing
against a successful author.

00:03:04.700 --> 00:03:07.243
If you look at Tim Ferriss or
Brian Tracy or Tony Robbins

00:03:07.243 --> 00:03:10.888
or anybody who's in the business
of personal development,

00:03:10.888 --> 00:03:12.676
taking my book and matching
it up and seeing how well

00:03:12.676 --> 00:03:15.798
we're doing against that
author, and then also taking

00:03:15.798 --> 00:03:17.790
a bit of advice from that author.

00:03:17.790 --> 00:03:20.577
What has Brian Tracy or
Tony Robbins said about

00:03:20.577 --> 00:03:24.164
book promotion, and then me
trying to go out and do it,

00:03:24.164 --> 00:03:26.049
and then reporting back
the next week, is something

00:03:26.049 --> 00:03:27.356
that's on my mind.

00:03:27.356 --> 00:03:29.249
It's a ton of work to put
that together, but I'm kind of

00:03:29.249 --> 00:03:31.673
curious to see, and I like that idea,

00:03:31.673 --> 00:03:33.481
from rookie to best-selling author.

00:03:33.481 --> 00:03:35.580
So, those are the things
that are on my plate, some

00:03:35.580 --> 00:03:38.384
of the things that I'm planning
in 2017 for the continuation

00:03:38.384 --> 00:03:40.663
of this book series.

00:03:40.663 --> 00:03:42.904
Good luck to all the contest entries.

00:03:42.904 --> 00:03:45.790
Next week will be the grand
reveal of who wins, so I'm

00:03:45.790 --> 00:03:48.640
excited for that, and I'm
curious to hear your thoughts

00:03:48.640 --> 00:03:50.288
about future video ideas.

00:03:50.288 --> 00:03:52.053
What did you think about
the list I threw out there?

00:03:52.053 --> 00:03:53.090
Like it?

00:03:53.090 --> 00:03:53.992
Leave it?

00:03:53.992 --> 00:03:55.588
Do you have other thoughts
that you'd like to see me

00:03:55.588 --> 00:03:57.426
talk about in this book series?

00:03:57.426 --> 00:03:59.157
Leave it down in the comments below.

00:03:59.157 --> 00:04:01.586
Thank you guys so much,
every week, for watching.

00:04:01.586 --> 00:04:02.499
I really appreciate it.

00:04:02.499 --> 00:04:04.552
Thank you for everybody who's
picked up a copy of the book

00:04:04.552 --> 00:04:05.707
and enjoyed it.

00:04:05.707 --> 00:04:09.244
Mad love, mad love, mad love, so much.

00:04:09.244 --> 00:04:10.417
I believe in you.

00:04:10.417 --> 00:04:12.565
I hope you guys continue
to believe in yourself,

00:04:12.565 --> 00:04:16.315
and whatever your one word is, much love.

00:04:16.315 --> 00:04:17.815
I'll see you soon.

